#### 2. Register the call with Slack {#register_call}

After you've made your quick response to Slack with a redirect `call_initiation_url`, you'll want to actually register the details of the call with Slack. Use the [`calls.add`](https://docs.slack.dev/reference/methods/calls.add.md) method to add the Call to Slack.

You'll receive an `id` from Slack in the response. Make sure you store the Call's `id`, since you'll need it to reference the call if you want to [update](#updating) or [end](#ending) the Call.

