## Usage info {#usage-info}

You can't add this block to app surfaces directly, but it will show up when [retrieving messages](https://docs.slack.dev/messaging/retrieving-messages.md) that contain remote files.

If you want to add remote files to messages, [follow our guide](https://docs.slack.dev/messaging/working-with-files.md#remote).

