## Usage info {#usage-info}

A `video` block is designed to embed videos in all app surfaces (e.g. link unfurls, messages, modals, App Home) — anywhere you can put blocks! To use the video block within your app, you must have the [`links.embed:write`](https://docs.slack.dev/reference/scopes/links.embed.write.md) scope.

The metadata received in the block payload will be used to construct the description, provider, and title of the video in all clients. Developers have the flexibility to leave non-mandatory fields null and use other blocks to format this content.

