### Disabling update checks {#disable-updates}

In CI/CD pipelines, set a `SLACK_SKIP_UPDATE` environment variable to `1` (or pass `--skip-update` on each command) to prevent the CLI from checking for new versions on every run. See [Version update notifications](https://docs.slack.dev/tools/slack-cli/guides/authorizing-the-slack-cli.md#version-updates) for details.

