## Architecture overview {#architecture}

The architecture powering ROSI is built on a JavaScript and TypeScript server-side [runtime environment](https://docs.slack.dev/tools/deno-slack-sdk/guides/installing-deno.md#deno-runtime), called [Deno](https://docs.slack.dev/tools/deno-slack-sdk/guides/developing-with-deno.md), and Amazon Web Services (AWS) infrastructure leveraging serverless best practices and capabilities. This enables developers to build and use modular building blocks in flexible solutions that can be easily updated as business needs change.

